<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HK WORLDBANK PLATFORM - Ultimate Masterpiece Final</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0b0f19;
            --bg-card: #131c2e;
            --bg-card-hover: #1a2640;
            --purple-primary: #8b5cf6;
            --purple-glow: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #1e293b;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .app-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 480px;
            height: 100vh;
            max-height: 920px;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        @media (min-width: 481px) {
            .app-container {
                border-radius: 24px;
            }
        }

        /* 상단 헤더 */
        .app-header {
            padding: 16px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c084fc, #a855f7, #ec4899);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .header-right {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .lang-selector {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: #a78bfa;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            max-width: 140px;
        }

        .hamburger-btn {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: #a78bfa;
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .hamburger-btn:hover {
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
        }

        /* 메인 컨텐츠 영역 */
        .app-content {
            flex: 1;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 90px;
        }

        .tab-content {
            display: none;
        }

        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
            animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .main-menu-grid {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .menu-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .menu-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px var(--purple-glow);
        }

        .menu-info {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .menu-icon {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 12px;
        }

        .menu-text h3 {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .menu-text p {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .menu-arrow {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .balance-card, .interest-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b, #311042);
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px var(--purple-glow);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            min-height: 110px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .balance-title {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .balance-amount {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .pi-box-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        }

        .pi-box-left {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .pi-icon-wrap {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .pi-box-title {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }

        .pi-box-value {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #d8b4fe;
        }

        .max-btn {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
            color: #d8b4fe;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .max-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);
        }

        .network-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .network-item {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 14px 10px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.83rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .network-item:hover {
            background: var(--purple-primary);
            color: white;
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px var(--purple-glow);
        }

        .drawer-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            z-index: 2000;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .drawer-panel {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 380px;
            height: 100%;
            background: #111827;
            border-left: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            padding: 24px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            animation: slideInRight 0.25s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes slideInRight {
            from { transform: translateX(100%); }
            to { transform: translateX(0); }
        }

        .drawer-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .drawer-title {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #d8b4fe;
        }

        .drawer-close {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .drawer-section-title {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin: 14px 0 8px 0;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .modal-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            z-index: 1000;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .modal-card {
            background: #131c2e;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5);
            border-radius: 20px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            max-height: 85vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 22px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
            animation: scaleUp 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes scaleUp {
            from { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .modal-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .modal-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .modal-close {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .modal-desc {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .form-label-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .form-label {
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            outline: none;
        }

        .form-input:focus {
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
        }

        .select-input {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            outline: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .info-box {
            background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);
            border: 1px dashed rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            color: #d8b4fe;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .warning-box {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #fca5a5;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--purple-primary);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px var(--purple-glow);
            margin-top: 6px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #7c3aed;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            border-color: var(--purple-primary);
            background: var(--bg-card-hover);
        }

        .back-btn {
            background: none;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        /* 하단 고정 네비게이션바 (5대 탭 고유 구성) */
        .bottom-nav {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 72px;
            background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .nav-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 3px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-item.active {
            color: var(--purple-primary);
        }

        .nav-icon {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="app-container">
    <!-- 상단 헤더 -->
    <header class="app-header">
        <div class="brand-logo" id="uiBrand">HK WORLDBANK</div>
        <div class="header-right">
            <!-- 60개국어 선택 드롭다운 확장 -->
            <select class="lang-selector" id="langSelect" onchange="changeLanguage(this.value)">
                <option value="ko">🇰🇷 한국어 (KO)</option>
                <option value="en">🇺🇸 English (EN)</option>
                <option value="zh">🇨🇳 中文 (ZH)</option>
                <option value="ja">🇯🇵 日本語 (JA)</option>
                <option value="vi">🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt</option>
                <option value="id">🇮🇩 Indonesian</option>
                <option value="es">🇪🇸 Español</option>
                <option value="fr">🇫🇷 Français</option>
                <option value="de">🇩🇪 Deutsch</option>
                <option value="ru">🇷🇺 Русский</option>
                <!-- 60개국어 확장 구조 지원 -->
            </select>
            <button class="hamburger-btn" onclick="openNavigatorDrawer()" title="네비게이터 메뉴">
                ☰
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 메인 컨텐츠 -->
    <main class="app-content">
       
        <!-- Tab 1: 메인 홈 허브 -->
        <div id="tab-home" class="tab-content active">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 3px;" id="hMainTitle">HK 통합 메인 허브</h2>
                <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted);" id="pMainSub">5대 핵심 기능 및 에코시스템 바로가기</p>
            </div>

            <div class="main-menu-grid">
                <div class="menu-card" onclick="switchTab('dashboard')">
                    <div class="menu-info">
                        <div class="menu-icon">📊</div>
                        <div class="menu-text">
                            <h3 id="m1Title">개인 자산 대시보드</h3>
                            <p id="m1Sub">실시간 잔액 및 Pi 자산 통합 관리</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-arrow">›</div>
                </div>

                <div class="menu-card" onclick="switchTab('trading')">
                    <div class="menu-info">
                        <div class="menu-icon">💱</div>
                        <div class="menu-text">
                            <h3 id="m2Title">사고 팔고 예금하기</h3>
                            <p id="m2Sub">10대 분산 연동망 볼트 실행</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-arrow">›</div>
                </div>

                <div class="menu-card" onclick="switchTab('support')">
                    <div class="menu-info">
                        <div class="menu-icon">🤖</div>
                        <div class="menu-text">
                            <h3 id="m3Title">고객센터 ASI 삐니</h3>
                            <p id="m3Sub">초지능 ASI 전담 AI 비서 철저한 KYC/KYB</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-arrow">›</div>
                </div>

                <div class="menu-card" onclick="switchTab('nav')">
                    <div class="menu-info">
                        <div class="menu-icon">🧭</div>
                        <div class="menu-text">
                            <h3 id="m4Title">네비게이터 (메뉴 보기)</h3>
                            <p id="m4Sub">백서·FAQ·3대정책·21개국법안 허브</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="menu-arrow">›</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tab 2: 개인 자산 대시보드 -->
        <div id="tab-dashboard" class="tab-content">
            <button class="back-btn" onclick="switchTab('home')">← <span id="btBack1">메인으로 돌아가기</span></button>
           
            <div class="balance-card">
                <div class="balance-title" id="balTitle">총 보유 자산 (KRW 환산)</div>
                <div class="balance-amount">₩ 128,450,000</div>
            </div>

            <div class="pi-box-card">
                <div class="pi-box-left">
                    <div class="pi-icon-wrap">🪙</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="pi-box-title" id="piBoxTitle">Pi 코인 보유량</div>
                        <div class="pi-box-value">1,250.00 Pi</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button class="max-btn" onclick="alert('메인넷 원장 동기화 완료!')" id="syncBtnText">동기화</button>
            </div>

            <!-- 실시간 이자 변동 (진짜 파이 채굴 방식 실시간 증가) -->
            <div class="interest-card">
                <div class="balance-title" id="interestTitle">실시간 누적 이자 (3년 31.41% APY 복리 실시간 마이닝)</div>
                <div class="balance-amount" style="color: #d8b4fe;"><span id="liveInterestVal">+ 398,751.070000</span> <span style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: normal; color: #a78bfa;">HK/Pi</span></div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;" id="dashSumTitle">📈 10대 분산 연동망 자산 현황</div>
                <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.4;" id="dashSumDesc">바이낸스 및 시중은행 통합 시대를 완벽히 방어하며, ASI 오케스트레이션과 KYC/KYB 철저 검증이 연동되어 있습니다.</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tab 3: 10대 분산 연동망 선택 뷰 (각각 고유 실행 화면 연결) -->
        <div id="tab-trading" class="tab-content">
            <button class="back-btn" onclick="switchTab('home')">← <span id="btBack2">메인으로 돌아가기</span></button>
            <div style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px;" id="netMainTitle">💱 10대 분산 연동망 (항목별 고유 실행)</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px;" id="netMainSub">아래 연동망 버튼을 누르면 즉시 해당 기능의 고유 실행 화면이 열립니다.</p>
           
            <div class="network-grid">
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(1)">🔗 1. 지갑 연결</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(2)">💸 2. 송금하기</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(3)">💳 3. 결제 연동</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(4)">🔒 4. 예치하기</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(5)">🎁 5. 보상 수령</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(6)">🏛️ 6. 기본소득</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(7)">🔄 7. 토큰 스왑</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(8)">🌐 8. DEX 스왑</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(9)">📊 9. LP 스테이킹</div>
                <div class="network-item" onclick="openNetworkModal(10)">🪙 10. 파이 수량</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tab 4: 고객센터 ASI 삐니 (메시지 보내기 기능 완벽 포함) -->
        <div id="tab-support" class="tab-content">
            <button class="back-btn" onclick="switchTab('home')">← <span id="btBack3">메인으로 돌아가기</span></button>
